<description>&lt;p&gt;Ethiopian forces have captured Gual Gemahalo near Badme and are fighting Eritrean-backed fighters in the area while also shelling Alamata. Somali militants attacked an Ethiopian base, killing 43 soldiers. Prime Minister Abiy Ahmed warned Eritrea to stop supporting Ethiopia's enemies and announced that Ethiopian Airlines resumed flights to Aksum, while Kenyan trucks were escorted across the volatile Moyale border after a ceasefire was reported. The conflict produced 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxPaURqMks0ZUxKX2lrYXNvdjI2WjJKRkNGcWlnX29janhtVTMtTGhlMmFIMDliNmxhY2dXUWcyRkZPT0Zrek9fLWdhQ1VtWHNydktjd1liR1A3NjJMZjhvQkcxU1dMVUsxTi0zUmxIWF9qZURFWGhXUGY5TWxuMmlqYlBqZFZuamh2X0NOc3hlTldnSU9vcEtrWENRcWZ1X053SFpMbE1NQk5VQS1PdEc1N3VEaGJkQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Borkena&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTE44QlNjM3JaMlY5c3BXV2YzTEN2SHl1Tk5rMmV4bTFQREg4a1VIeVEzQ3FxTzZwR1p6QUFCRG9nOXpfckM2QTJiVENLSGhqVkg3WUxRTGFsT3ZUUmZqLVU2Tmo0b0FMeXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;DNE Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTFBXU2czU2V2RHNXalVEZkROTFdSS09lcDhFQlBQSG5jWmxjeF9hZUhjMHNoTUt3N0plT2N4Q0tlSll3MV9zU1l6aE04eW1LWlhfWEVLa2Zac1I2ekJmMWRFMWFmQ0UzRHRvSERuNGFuc2hfYmw2YW9YQXFNdkY?oc=5&quot;&gt;kulu-media.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxOSm83NGttVXdoY2NRM1kxS1A2ZWlfVUxRV21WX2NFX1hFMmtwMXJJVkdOcWNJSkh6YXZZdmwwVDQxTzFsellkRTh0S3VtX09kSW5IeTNpWkNxTk1FSUFWOHhwMjVUZGdMRDJDMFV1QWQ1X0xjQmJRWm5wZEFyNno4cG1ROHQ3eHhYZ1E3NGY1TDM3WW1udkFUZ0w5NGxQSGJyREZsUDZaZFZEMUNSLVVQZHdQOHdiaC1lQ1MwdTFkeXN3ZGxUMVQtM3p6UFQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiRkFVX3lxTE02Smo2bzAwaDdCMXFGR3Nhc1ZnQXVxQ